  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Qt: Treat empty capture filter as valid",
  "description": "An empty capture filter means capture everything, but the new\nFilterExpressionEdit only reported Valid/Deprecated as valid and never\nemitted for an untouched empty field, so double-clicking an interface on\nthe welcome screen failed with Invalid capture filter.\n\nFold the Empty state into the capture validity signal and default\ncapture_filter_valid_ to true.\n\nFixes #21303 \n\nAI-Assisted: no",
